  from (values
    ('yes-spa-bali-yes-hair-bliss-kuta-legian', 'a612ca9fbacc7bf1791038c7611f5a6d', 'Foot and leg massage at Yes Spa Bali & Yes Hair Bliss, a Legian day spa, costs 130K IDR for an hour. Facials and spa packages are among its 59 treatments, and the longest lasts three hours. You book on its website.'),
    ('bali-dream-spa-lovina-lovina', '25443b14527ca04705065271abe49cea', 'Bali Dream Spa, a Lovina day spa you book by WhatsApp, lists seven treatments: Balinese massage, facials, manicures and a couple treatment.'),
    ('earthbound-lovina', '8d3201704acba0513e344fc999817c6e', 'In Lovina, Earthbound is a wellness spa whose 19 treatments include foot massage, hot stone and body scrubs. The longest treatment runs six hours, and booking is on its own website.'),
    ('jaya-spa-lovina', 'bf2ddb06c03044cb76794b749e57b320', 'Jaya Spa, a day spa in Lovina, charges 350K IDR for an hour of its traditional Lovina body massage. Hair treatments and anti-aging facials are also on the 15-treatment list, and the longest session runs three hours. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('rnd-lovina-spa-lovina', '2b81d4b2dd3a05cffc38b0b9cf6ac34a', 'Body scrubs, facials, foot massage and a couple treatment are among the 20 treatments at RND Lovina Spa, a day spa. A 60-minute Balinese massage costs 140K IDR, treatments go up to two hours, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('santhika-retreat-center-lovina', 'a7aef952626f02277ad619ff134a712c', 'Santhika Retreat Center, a Lovina wellness spa, lists 66 treatments including traditional massage, facials and a couple treatment. A full-body Balinese massage costs 200K IDR for an hour. The longest session is 150 minutes, and you book on the centre''s website.'),
    ('bamboo-spa-at-munduk-moding-plantation-nature-re-munduk', 'a0cb9888c93e57f521ae891a406c6ade', 'Bamboo Spa is the spa at Munduk Moding Plantation Nature Resort, with 16 treatments including aromatherapy, Balinese massage and traditional massage. The longest takes 135 minutes, and booking is on the resort''s website.'),
    ('mahony-spa-wellness-munduk', 'e7ea49548bcb7e9d8de8fd78efea4a04', 'Mahony Spa & Wellness in Munduk charges 399K IDR for an hour of its Munduk foot ritual. Spa packages and traditional and Balinese massage are also on the 22-treatment list, with the longest at two and a half hours. Book on its website.'),
    ('mondo-surf-lifestyle-village-munduk', 'b2a35fd27d931d1cdf3842adc2a01a21', 'Mondo Surf & Lifestyle Village has a massage studio in Munduk with six treatments, among them Balinese massage, reflexology and a four-hands massage. An hour of reflexology foot massage is 230K IDR, booked on its own website.'),
    ('munduk-moding-plantation-munduk', '945372574b558b565389ed4828d259ed', 'Munduk Moding Plantation has a resort spa with nine treatments on its list, Balinese massage, sauna and yoga among them. Booking is by WhatsApp.'),
    ('munduk-tentrem-resort-munduk', '8fedbca713cc3f57b5f1289dfdd5f550', 'The spa at Munduk Tentrem Resort has 52 treatments, with shiatsu, Balinese massage and aromatherapy on the list. Treatments last up to two and a half hours, and you book on the resort''s website.'),
    ('okana-spa-munduk', '2ce16ac51b3964b80c18db3026e78a63', 'With 33 treatments on its list, OKANA Spa in Munduk is a day spa covering traditional massage, facials and manicures. The longest treatment runs four hours, and bookings go through the spa''s website.'),
    ('putu-bali-spa-home-care-munduk', '423a5354d9dc45b4e366b237a61a7a48', 'Putu Bali Spa Home Care, a wellness spa in Munduk, takes bookings by WhatsApp for its five treatments. Foot massage is 200K IDR for 60 minutes, and aromatherapy is on the list too.'),
    ('sanctua-bedugul-munduk', 'cab389f0b05bd863a4bce4288e83d1b7', 'A couple massage is one of the 13 treatments at Sanctua Bedugul, a wellness spa in Munduk. You book on its website.'),
    ('3d-relaxation-center-nusa-dua', '6e5ff61e0c90f13c5e61430eac217247', 'The 87 treatments at 3D Relaxation Center, a Nusa Dua spa, include manicures, traditional massage, spa packages and a couple treatment. The longest is five hours. Foot reflexology costs 175K IDR for 60 minutes, booked on the centre''s website.'),
    ('adi-spa-healing-healthy-and-wellness-nusa-dua-nusa-dua', '6e47e9f32a85aabc138320b0cecbb35e', 'Adi Spa in Nusa Dua keeps five treatments on its list, including Balinese, traditional and couple massage. Booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('bali-relaxing-resort-and-spa-nusa-dua-nusa-dua', '02b5a5d53c8bf0f6f581e6bc7d838f37', 'Bali Relaxing Resort And Spa Nusa Dua runs a resort spa with seven treatments, among them aromatherapy, Thai massage and foot massage. A foot massage is 350K IDR.'),
    ('bali-relaxing-resort-spa-nusa-dua', '03700d754c00fb9e9dad3f19ace72c3c', 'Bali Relaxing Resort & Spa has a resort spa in Nusa Dua with four treatments, including Balinese massage, a flower bath and reflexology.'),
    ('chi-massage-luxury-spa-nusa-dua-bali-nusa-dua', '1818d1dc54302267384e2c0d97fec9af', 'An hour of foot reflexology at Chi Massage & Luxury Spa costs 380K IDR. The Nusa Dua day spa also lists spa packages and manicures among its 11 treatments, and you book on its website.'),
    ('frangipani-bali-spa-nusa-dua', '3fcf9c1603d9f24f5d6234f4825b626d', 'Frangipani Bali Spa is a Nusa Dua wellness spa whose ten treatments include a couple massage, Balinese massage and an anti-aging facial. The quick couple massage costs 800K IDR for an hour. Treatments can run to five hours, and bookings go by WhatsApp.'),
    ('heavenly-spa-by-westin-nusa-dua', '0c0b9168ceada756f7b9f434299e0ec8', 'Yoga is among the 11 treatments at Heavenly Spa by Westin, a day spa in Nusa Dua. Booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('ijen-spa-nusa-dua', '277b2829875ad2e336680ccd7f73f333', 'At Ijen Spa in Nusa Dua, a 60-minute foot massage is 249K IDR. The day spa''s 19 treatments also include deep tissue, Balinese massage and spa packages, and none runs past two hours. Book on its website.'),
    ('jiwa-spa-nusa-dua', 'e949b31efcbd982b7d5b372c6c2e7f7a', 'Jiwa Spa in Nusa Dua has six treatments on its list, among them traditional massage, a detox treatment and spa packages.'),
    ('karma-spa-therapy-nusa-dua', '7518821a8427f73ea4dd3b4351a302bd', 'Seven treatments make up the list at Karma Spa Therapy, a day spa in Nusa Dua, among them lomi lomi and deep tissue. A 60-minute Balinese massage costs 200K IDR; bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('kayumanis-spa-nusa-dua-nusa-dua', '37c953ba200fe2056f9ab57ef0587e5d', 'An hour of relaxing massage costs 1,025K IDR at Kayumanis Spa Nusa Dua, a wellness spa you book through Fresha. Its 19 treatments include traditional massage, spa packages and facials, and the longest runs three hours.'),
    ('merusaka-spa-nusa-dua', '04503a14de55eab1e08b1bc9f46a0dba', 'Merusaka Spa''s warm oil massage is 675K IDR for an hour. The Nusa Dua day spa lists 27 treatments, among them spa packages, Balinese massage and facials, with sessions of up to three hours. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('mim-spa-nusa-dua', '04eeed2f51d8f4ca1bf01bf613ea17c6', 'MIM SPA, a wellness spa in Nusa Dua, lists 26 treatments, traditional massage, facials and detox treatments among them. You book on its website.'),
    ('mybalihealing-nusa-dua', '35bc52b5561d87b220596ddccd6c2427', 'At myBALIhealing, a Nusa Dua day spa booked by WhatsApp, the ten treatments on the list include aromatherapy, deep tissue and reflexology.'),
    ('royal-orchid-spa-nusa-dua', '0118bec98446d04f88a8cb9b7c4ad824', 'Shirodhara and Balinese massage sit alongside spa packages and a couple treatment on the 25-treatment list at Royal Orchid Spa in Nusa Dua. The royal traditional Balinese massage is 385K IDR for 60 minutes, and treatments go up to four hours. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('samantha-spa-at-santika-beach-resort-nusa-dua', 'a9c4034bad327810b2ef7d476edd8bd1', 'Samantha Spa is the day spa at Santika Beach Resort in Nusa Dua. Traditional massage, body treatments and spa packages are among its nine treatments, and you book on its website.'),
    ('samuh-beach-nusa-dua', '2f3c1aa8626729accbcbfc23a4509005', 'Thai, traditional and couple massage are on the 28-treatment list at SAMUH BEACH, a spa in Nusa Dua. Treatments run up to three hours, and booking is on the venue''s site.'),
    ('sekar-jagat-spa-nusa-dua-nusa-dua', '4465b564c41fd7d7bc827c954b3447cb', 'For an hour of Bali massage, Sekar Jagat Spa Nusa Dua charges 375K IDR. Traditional massage, shirodhara and spa packages are also among the day spa''s seven treatments, and you book on its website.'),
    ('serene-bali-spa-nusa-dua', '72b14f0f3fa231aebb22b47c7ac4bf89', 'Serene Bali Spa, a day spa in Nusa Dua, has 13 treatments, with aromatherapy and shirodhara next to traditional massage. Bookings go by WhatsApp.'),
    ('sofitel-spa-with-clarins-nusa-dua', '9fd5961c00ae6cd164dc15cd844606e5', 'Sofitel Spa with Clarins, a wellness spa in Nusa Dua, has five treatments, with a spa package, recovery sessions and Balinese massage among them. You book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('sunshine-spa-nusa-dua-nusa-dua', '69c69058c59d6886ddbcb49ce4718d69', 'Sunshine Spa Nusa Dua is a day spa whose 29 treatments cover facials as well as traditional and Balinese massage. Bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-ritz-carlton-spa-amelia-island-nusa-dua', '011b15bff14bd7fbcf34892824067bad', 'Facials, traditional massage, manicures and a couple treatment are among the 58 treatments at The Ritz-Carlton Spa, Amelia Island, a spa in Nusa Dua. Treatments last up to 150 minutes; book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('the-spa-at-hotel-nikko-bali-benoa-beach-nusa-dua', '867e323a92de4de5331e10fe4456e92d', 'The Spa at Hotel Nikko Bali Benoa Beach, a wellness spa in Nusa Dua, lists 15 treatments, including body scrubs and traditional and Balinese massage. An hour of Balinese massage costs 400K IDR; book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-u-spa-by-bali-relaxing-resort-nusa-dua', '5c340d8a30328cd83a45d2821bef8219', 'A 45-minute stress reliever massage costs 350K IDR at The U Spa by Bali Relaxing Resort, a spa in Nusa Dua. Its 14 treatments include Balinese and Thai massage and aromatherapy, and run as long as three hours. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('tunjungsari-spa-nusa-dua', '45d2870ffa2ab091c0c705f06778716c', 'Shiatsu at Tunjungsari Spa, a day spa in Nusa Dua, costs 350K IDR for an hour. The longest of its 40 treatments takes three hours, and the list also includes body scrubs, body masks and facials. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('zahra-luxury-spa-nusa-dua', 'e813e6c546ecadee4a0d4389e23ef881', 'Zahra Luxury Spa in Nusa Dua has 38 treatments, a couple massage among them, along with traditional massage and spa packages. A 60-minute foot massage costs 410K IDR, and the longest treatment lasts four hours. Book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('ayu-spa-salon-sanur', 'fdaaf9a8130b6aeeae5d84f85ced9f9b', 'Facials, hair treatments and haircuts are on the five-treatment list at Ayu Spa & Salon in Sanur, booked through its website.'),
    ('blissful-senja-sanur', '41103e5b177888b760810113c06f7cb5', 'Blissful Senja, a massage studio in Sanur, charges 200K IDR for an hour of foot massage. Its 31 treatments include traditional massage, reflexology, deep tissue and a couple treatment. The longest treatment is two hours, and you book on the studio''s website.'),
    ('griya-santrian-beach-resort-spa-sanur', '29455e57016f5ce69ae27bc0b49b0e23', 'Reflexology at the day spa of Griya Santrian Beach Resort & Spa in Sanur costs 443K IDR for an hour. The 25 treatments also take in manicures and pedicures, and bookings go by WhatsApp.'),
    ('koa-spa-sanur', 'd117a6e475cbb18e01bd60080efb2575', 'You book Koa Spa, a day spa in Sanur, by WhatsApp. Its 12 treatments include traditional and Balinese massage and reflexology, and massage add-ons cost 200K IDR for 30 minutes.'),
    ('massage-sanur-sanur', '7d86dfa7c660df3eba6a75af82e99f50', 'Hot stone, deep tissue and Balinese massage are on the 14-treatment list at Massage Sanur, a wellness centre. A traditional Balinese massage costs 400K IDR for an hour, treatments run to two hours, and you book by WhatsApp.')
